---

---

<section
  id='about'
  class='relative overflow-hidden px-4 py-16 md:px-6 md:py-24'
>
  <!-- Subtle gradient blob -->
  <div class='pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden'>
    <div
      class='absolute -left-32 top-1/2 h-[400px] w-[400px] -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-500/20 via-blue-500/10 to-transparent blur-3xl'
    >
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class='relative mx-auto max-w-4xl'>
    <h2
      class='mb-8 text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-muted-foreground'
    >
      About Us
    </h2>

    <div class='space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-foreground/90'>
      <p class='text-xl font-medium text-foreground'>
        Welcome to React ATL - Atlanta's community for developers building with
        React and modern web technologies.
      </p>

      <p>
        We host monthly events that go beyond just code. Yes, we cover React,
        React Native, and the latest in the JavaScript ecosystem - but we also
        dive into the topics that shape your career: engineering leadership,
        AI-powered workflows, security best practices, and navigating the tech
        job market.
      </p>

      <p>
        Our events take many forms. Some months feature deep technical talks on
        testing, architecture, or animations. Others bring fireside chats with
        engineering leaders or hands-on workshops on AI tools. We also make time
        for what matters most - connecting with fellow developers over good food
        and conversation at our social events and holiday parties.
      </p>

      <p>
        We're part of Atlanta's broader tech community, regularly partnering
        with Modern Web, AtlantaJS, VueATL, and REFACTR.TECH to bring you
        diverse perspectives and bigger events.
      </p>

      <p>
        Stay connected: Follow us on Bluesky
        <a
          href='https://bsky.app/profile/reactatl.dev'
          class='text-cyan-400 underline underline-offset-2 transition-colors hover:text-cyan-300'
          target='_blank'
          rel='noopener noreferrer'>@reactatl.dev</a
        > for event updates, and join our
        <a
          href='https://discord.gg/6whjwYTRjj'
          class='text-cyan-400 underline underline-offset-2 transition-colors hover:text-cyan-300'
          target='_blank'
          rel='noopener noreferrer'>Discord</a
        > to keep the conversation going between meetups.
      </p>

      <p class='text-foreground'>
        Whether you're looking to level up technically, grow as a leader, or
        simply find your people in Atlanta's tech scene - you're welcome here.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
